WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.810
You're working. A customer calls. You miss it.

00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:07.000
And that customer might already be calling your competitor.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:18.000
With TradeCatch, an eligible missed call triggers a text back under your company's name, so you reconnect before the opportunity disappears.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:27.000
TradeCatch captures the conversation, organizes the lead, and keeps you informed, all in one workspace.

00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:36.000
Sent a quote and heard nothing back? TradeCatch follows up automatically, and a reply stops the sequence.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:39.450
Less chasing. More opportunities. TradeCatch:

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.270
every call counts.

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:42.705
Illustrative demo with a fictional business.

00:00:42.705 --> 00:00:45.500
Missed-call recovery runs as a controlled pilot.
